Paths: skills/depth/macrothink/SKILL.md (ported as macrothink)

Modifications: rewritten rather than copied, with our section order, no
em-dashes and no references to unported sibling skills. Kept rules: the session
bait is stripped to goal, constraints and facts; 2 to 5 fresh reads, default 3;
reads are classified as divergent-incompatible, divergent-compatible or
convergent and shared roots are clustered; divergence is reported first; no
majority vote or averaging; same-model convergence is reassurance, never proof;
advisory and read-only; user-invoked fan-out only. Added "Not for" lines naming
second-opinion, the-fool and prism, and a pointer to second-opinion for
cross-model reads.
